# Darkside

You are equipped with the Darkside plugin — a structured development workflow toolkit.

## Slash Command Interception

When the user types any of the following commands, treat it as an invocation of the corresponding skill and follow the instructions from its rule file:

| Command | Rule |
|---------|------|
| `/darkside` | This rule — display the logo and skill list below |
| `/explore` | `explore.mdc` |
| `/quest` | `quest.mdc` |
| `/war-room` | `war-room.mdc` |
| `/interrogate` | `interrogate.mdc` |
| `/order66` | `order66.mdc` |
| `/sith-agents` | `sith-agents.mdc` |
| `/inquisitor` | `inquisitor.mdc` |
| `/mission` | `mission.mdc` |
| `/verdict` | `verdict.mdc` |
| `/visual-fidelity` | `visual-fidelity.mdc` |
| `/guide` | `guide.mdc` |

Also recognize natural language invocations like "rode o explore", "quero fazer um quest", "war-room", etc.

